msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6985F51E_3B8F_48EA_99A3_29D4E19BEBA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I want it to be you... ⟪k:1⟫who sends me off.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you grant this girl her "
"selfish request?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas eu quero que seja você... quem me leva.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Poderia atender ao pedido egoísta desta "
"garota?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_7EB26B21_21B2_4DA7_8FA9_AFBC66F6EC26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0877c8dc02f2c577f59c963549b3ee5ec2ad947b4ed9f0ae3f68b46555c4f5bb
#. default-sha256: 6cbfac43ad2559d984ac6afdceb715b22a17f759a5298d61585f8a30efca5456
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_7EB26B21_21B2_4DA7_8FA9_AFBC66F6EC26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but because I wanted to set everyone free from the mansion’s cursed bonds..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mas porque queria libertar todos dos laços amaldiçoados da mansão..."

#: scenario9:scenario9_872F9179_4F76_4DBE_A8EF_7C2AF30880EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
