msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_872F9179_4F76_4DBE_A8EF_7C2AF30880EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And you’re asking me... ⟪k:1⟫to eradicate your soul?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E você está me pedindo... ⟪k:1⟫para erradicar sua alma?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_6DE8A0BC_1CED_4C30_AF0B_8F2705D2ECF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13f04d9c31b717470ebd9732e827c5aebbebce7048d591785749386ac35e7094
#. default-sha256: eae762bc367fe113ddf1367f9c916c5b8810dc8235bb7997c0cbad0b06684771
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_6DE8A0BC_1CED_4C30_AF0B_8F2705D2ECF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫must⟪k:2⟫ be destroyed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu ⟪k:1⟫preciso⟪k:2⟫ ser destruída."

#: scenario9:scenario9_FFE289E9_5988_48FC_A478_DDF26D5199E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 555713e3d84a52b032a1e2f927c23b181fcb6dbc57af9da056dec070bea66fdb
#. default-sha256: a4c9ecdeb5cf4d86d29d7186048d0ee8455539ba0e21729e5608d7b3a3e0e200
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_FFE289E9_5988_48FC_A478_DDF26D5199E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While it’s true Morgana wished for misfortune to befall them... ⟪k:1⟫if I hadn’t been there, "
"none of their tragedies would have taken place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora seja verdade que Morgana desejava que infortúnio caísse sobre eles... ⟪k:1⟫se eu não "
"estivesse lá, nenhuma de suas tragédias teria acontecido."

#: scenario9:scenario9_80BD455B_7180_4F27_9EFC_691B744EA819
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41bddbf7f11ed572be01b09832e09d0c47bc9b10c10e8aec63f086b9e6f7ee14
#. default-sha256: f386b95ae87a590c34216d885af7227a979f39571fb13415f685362548ba82de
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_80BD455B_7180_4F27_9EFC_691B744EA819"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Culpable?⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Culpada?⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario9:scenario9_E4B3A56C_AE7E_4159_A51A_05132BF3EF3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 148afc4ed9e48cdd30c895b339c29d00e175c94419c6fb6bd1387af9b32b7505
